<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Mining keeps zinc prices unchanged.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Mining keeps zinc prices unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsui Mining and Smelting Co Ltd said on Monday it had left its selling price for zinc unchanged at 151,000 yen per tonne.</p>
<p>Major Japanese smelters periodically review their selling prices and change them in line with market prices and currency rates.</p>
</text>
